            </note>
            <note corresp="#d303-f2" n="76" xml:id="d303-f2-content">
                <p>Emilien Lagarde, head of the Near East section of the French Foreign Office.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d303-f3" n="77" xml:id="d303-f3-content">
                <p>Marshal Henri Philippe Pétain, French Chief of State.</p>
            </note>
